              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "litentjo1"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My grandmother used to make these but I never did ask her for a recipe and I have regretted that for years!! Non of my swedish cook books include a recipe for klimp....\nMy grandmother is from Harjedalen in northern Sweden and they eat klimp with \"messmor sas\", which is a gravy made with whey cheese!! May sound a bit strange but it's delicious and is one of my fondest childhood memories:)\nThanks for sharing this wonderful recipe!!",
